{
  "about": [
    "Fixtures for scripts/ci/test_post_merge_proof.sh, which runs the real",
    "post-merge proof selector from .github/workflows/ci.yml against a fake gh.",
    "",
    "Placeholders are replaced by the harness with real object ids from a",
    "throwaway git repository: __BASE__ (the pushed commit's parent), __HEAD__",
    "(the pull-request head), __HEAD_TREE__ (the head's tree), __SAME__ (a squash",
    "commit whose tree equals the head's), __DIFF__ (a squash commit with other",
    "content) and __DIFF_TREE__.",
    "",
    "Proof source A is a successful merge_group run for the pushed commit. Source",
    "B is the merged pull request's own final successful pull_request run, and it",
    "is accepted only when the tree and the parent relationship both hold. Every",
    "mismatch must leave complement=false with no proven lane.",
    "",
    "Each mismatch case carries the accepting answers for every check that follows",
    "the one it breaks, so deleting that check turns a refusal into a proof and the",
    "case fails. A mismatch case that stopped at the first missing route would pass",
    "even after the guard it describes was removed."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "source-a",
      "description": "a successful merge-queue run for the pushed commit proves the lanes it executed",
      "sha": "__SAME__",
      "routes": [
        {
          "match": "^repos/[^/]+/[^/]+/actions/workflows/ci\\.yml/runs\\?event=merge_group&head_sha=[0-9a-f]{40}&per_page=100$",
          "body": {
            "workflow_runs": [
              {"id": 500, "head_sha": "__SAME__", "conclusion": "success", "run_started_at": "2026-11-10T10:00:00Z"},
              {"id": 501, "head_sha": "__SAME__", "conclusion": "failure", "run_started_at": "2026-11-10T11:00:00Z"}
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "match": "^repos/[^/]+/[^/]+/actions/runs/500/jobs\\?filter=all&per_page=100$",
          "body": {
            "jobs": [
              {"name": "Test agent (ubuntu-24.04, shard 1/4)", "conclusion": "success"},
              {"name": "CLI automation", "conclusion": "success"},
              {"name": "Analyze client", "conclusion": "failure"},
              {"name": "Validate docs and governance", "conclusion": "skipped"}
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "expect": {"complement": true, "proof": "merge-queue run 500", "proven": "agent-tests cli-automation"}
    },
    {
      "name": "source-a-jobs-unreadable",
      "description": "a proof run whose jobs cannot be read proves nothing",
      "sha": "__SAME__",
      "routes": [
        {
          "match": "^repos/[^/]+/[^/]+/actions/workflows/ci\\.yml/runs\\?event=merge_group&head_sha=[0-9a-f]{40}&per_page=100$",
          "body": {
            "workflow_runs": [
              {"id": 500, "head_sha": "__SAME__", "conclusion": "success", "run_started_at": "2026-11-10T10:00:00Z"}
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "match": "^repos/[^/]+/[^/]+/actions/runs/500/jobs\\?",
          "error": true
        }
      ],
      "expect": {"complement": false, "proof": "", "proven": ""}
    },
